        (5, 'One of the great undiscovered breeds', "Manx aren't as fashionable as Bengals or Maine Coons but they should be. The combination of dog-like loyalty, hunting instinct, intelligence, and complete stable temperament makes them exceptional companions. Mine has been the best cat I've owned in twenty years of keeping cats. I'll always have a Manx."),
